  "importantCorrection": "The older GfxWorld preview path used image-name hash as sufficient IPAK identity and could retain same-name wrong-data variants. v9 rebinds exact content only when the retained GfxImage identity closes to the exact two-hash IPAK key, or to one unique same-dataHash payload with matching CRC and dimensions. Where exact bytes are not locally available, the old user-facing preview may remain but is explicitly marked unverified and is not counted as solved.",
